# Keep the version-stamped Cargo manifests LF on every platform. GitHub
# Windows runners default to core.autocrlf=true, which would check these out
# CRLF and break the exact line matching in scripts/stamp-release-version.mjs
# (it throws "Cargo.toml is missing [workspace.package] version").
Cargo.toml text eol=lf
Cargo.lock text eol=lf
